url: "https://github.com/zimmermaps/hypsographic_demography"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
license: "MIT"

abstract: >
  Reproducible analysis code accompanying the manuscript
  "Hypsographic Demography: Global Population Structure and Change Across
  Elevation Gradients" and the Global Elevation–Settlement Demographic
  Dataset (GESD), version 1. The workflows reproduce the manuscript figures,
  demographic summaries, within-country comparisons, and sensitivity analyses.

keywords:
